  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 3417,
  "text_len": 18
 },
 {
  "id": "sce103:00D73",
  "jp": "レオーネ「わかってるよ。トウヤも忙しいだろうし、{nl}{ctl:3C3E}{face:041602}{ctl:013E}{face:041C03}{ctl:023E}{face:041C05}　ねっ、掃除手田って」",
